== Usage ==
{{main|Armor#Usage}}
Wearing netherite armor reduces damage taken from [[Armor#Damage types|most damage types]].

=== Statistics ===
When a full set of netherite armor is worn, the set provides {{armor|20}} armor points, {{armor|12}} armor toughness, and 40% knockback resistance.
