=== Knockback resistance ===
{{Main|Knockback resistance}}
Each [[netherite]] armor piece gives a [[knockback resistance]] of 1 (10%), which results in a [[knockback (mechanic)|knockback]] reduction of 40% with a full set. The [[Blast Protection]] enchantment can be applied to armor to increase the user's [[explosion knockback resistance]].
